# GoReleaser build output
/dist/

# The Elixir suite's workflow parity driver. Go only lets an `internal/`
# package be imported from an import path under this module, so
# `Tend.Workflow.GoDriver` writes its one-file main package here rather than
# into a temp directory, and removes it again. The leading dot keeps it out of
# `go build ./...`; this keeps a crashed run's leftovers out of `git status`.
/.tend-workflow-driver-*/
